# Biome accuracy

Species, forage, and climate in these paths must match `docs/research/biomes/<id>.md`.

Do not add a tree, berry, or animal because it “looks Viking” or “looks foresty.”

New species require a research pass with sources, then a spawn/art name using that species (`tree_spruce`, not `tree1`).

`coastal_north` is Vinland boreal coast. Do not place river-valley, plains, or bayou species there until that biome is in play.
